(  Traditional memorial feast held in winter honoring family members who) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  passed away during the preceding year. Pine torches are lit along) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  pathways to guide departed spirits to Kasa Akhava \(ancestral realm\).) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
